<title>UK: Meggitt in Boeing, Lockheed deals.</title>
<headline>Meggitt in Boeing, Lockheed deals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Meggitt Plc said on Wednesday its Meggitt Avionics division had signed an agreement to supply solid-state clocks to Boeing Commercial Airplane Group.</p>
<p>The seven-year agreement has an option to be extended another two years and annual sales are expected to exceed $2.0 million at peak production rates, Meggitt said in a statement.</p>
<p>Separately, Meggitt said it had won a deal to supply the secondary flight display system for the Lockheed Martin Corp Joint Strike Fighter. It gave no financial details.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
